# The blades' own cost by its parts, on the standing views of perf-meadow.bench (reports/engine/2026-11-17-grass-cost):
# each view as it is, then with the blades through the whole vertex stage and off the screen (`grass parts 32768`:
# the frame less this is their rasterising and pixels), then with the blades dropped at the start of the vertex stage
# (`grass parts 128`: the difference to the sample before is the vertex stage's work). Read the pass `Grass` of
# gpu_passes (OPENGOTHIC_GPU_PASSES=1); `grass parts 128` also paints the ground in bands, so the pass `GBuffer`
# and the passes of light are not comparable in that sample.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
# view 1 of perf-meadow.bench: the densest
goto pos 41701 3320 795
clear 3000
cam at 41452 3421 -168 40003 3790 -1503
wait 20000
grass stats
perf sample perf-grass/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
grass parts 32768
wait 2000
perf sample perf-grass/view-1-vertex
wait 8000
perf stop
grass parts 128
wait 2000
perf sample perf-grass/view-1-hidden
wait 8000
perf stop
grass parts 0
# view 2: `stone`
goto pos 40003 3790 -1503
cam at 40503 3581 -902 41503 3480 -902
wait 20000
grass stats
perf sample perf-grass/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
grass parts 32768
wait 2000
perf sample perf-grass/view-2-vertex
wait 8000
perf stop
grass parts 128
wait 2000
perf sample perf-grass/view-2-hidden
wait 8000
perf stop
grass parts 0
